  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AppwriteOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Appwrite via its Databases REST API. Appwrite is an open-source, self-hostable Firebase/Supabase alternative with auth, databases, storage, and functions. No Appwrite SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- fix: preserve Appwrite read errors and reject partial page success (e61269c)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AppwriteOASIS",
